  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GreenFuture Business</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This pilot project addresses the critical need for sustainable business practices in Zimbabwe by educating and empowering students in universities. The main focus of the bootcamp is how to integrate environmental sustainability into business operations and through workshops that equip the participants to be the leaders in the movement. Participants will be anchored to not only bring this forward to the workforce, but also to be able to train others. The target group for this initiative includes business students, emerging entrepreneurs, and other college students committed to making a positive change towards environmental stewardship in their industries.</narrative>
  </description>
